{"product_id":"uwell-whirl-s2-pod-kit","title":"Uwell Whirl S2 Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Whirl S2 Pod Kit, featuring a 900mAh battery, 3.5mL pod capacity, and utilizes the Whirl S2 Coil Series to deliver delicious vapor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Pods\u003cbr\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Coils\u003cbr\u003eUwell Whirl S Coils\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Whirl S2 Pod Kit is sleek and visually striking, while maintaining a lightweight and portable form-factor. Holding up to 3.5mL of eJuice or nicotine salts within the bottom filled pod, the Whirl S2 Pod System can be used throughout the day without needing a refill. With replaceable coils, the Whirl S2 calls upon the new Whirl S2 Coil Series, but is still compatible with Whirl S Coils.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 105mm by 20.5mm by 20.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 900mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage: 17W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.8\/1.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3.5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Bottom - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Whirl S2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm Whirl S2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Whirl S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAirflow: Rotate Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\